{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/424","tmdb_id":424,"title":"辛德勒的名单","original_title":"Schindler's List","overview":"1939年，波兰在纳粹德国的统治下，党卫军对犹太人进行了隔离统治。德国商人奥斯卡·辛德勒（连姆·尼森 Liam Neeson 饰）来到德军统治下的克拉科夫，开设了一间搪瓷厂，生产军需用品。凭着出众的社交能力和大量的金钱，辛德勒和德军建立了良好的关系，他的工厂雇用犹太人工作，大发战争财。\r 1943年，克拉科夫的犹太人遭到了惨绝人寰的大屠杀，辛德勒目睹这一切，受到了极大的震撼，他贿赂军官，让自己的工厂成为集中营的附属劳役营，在那些疯狂屠杀的日子里，他的工厂也成为了犹太人的避难所。\r 1944年，德国战败前夕，屠杀犹太人的行动越发疯狂，辛德勒向德军军官开出了1200人的名单，倾家荡产买下了这些犹太人的生命。在那些暗无天日的岁月里，拯救一个人，就是拯救全世界。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cDI6MrIi12uQxfipiNIeJPYljy.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zb6fM1CX41D9rF9hdgclu0peUmy.jpg","release_date":"1993-12-15","year":"1993","runtime":"195 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":8.6,"tmdb_votes":17385,"tmdb_rating":"8.6 / 10 from 17385 users","genres":["剧情","历史","战争"],"languages":["German","Polish","Hebrew","English"],"countries":["United States of America"],"production_companies":["Amblin Entertainment"],"directors":[{"name":"史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格","id":488}],"producers":[{"name":"杰拉尔德·R·莫伦","id":2211},{"name":"Branko Lustig","id":930},{"name":"史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格","id":488}],"cast":[{"id":3896,"name":"连姆·尼森","original_name":"Liam Neeson","character":"Oskar Schindler","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/g0iIEyt9ILiKTG0g8K69US5VtLy.jpg"},{"id":2282,"name":"本·金斯利","original_name":"Ben Kingsley","character":"Itzhak Stern","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/vQtBqpF2HDdzbfXHDzR4u37i1Ac.jpg"},{"id":5469,"name":"拉尔夫·费因斯","original_name":"Ralph Fiennes","character":"Amon Goeth","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/pCnVXH1Uo2ODoOit4UXni8OD9VB.jpg"},{"id":6692,"name":"卡罗琳·古道尔","original_name":"Caroline Goodall","character":"Emilie Schindler","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/4cagGtMqACvkuw6Llq8Li8UJ1AR.jpg"},{"id":6693,"name":"乔纳森·萨加尔","original_name":"יהונתן סגל","character":"Poldek Pfefferberg","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/waxNDsgfw7CXXO3L